<title>FRANCE: Union Miniere sets new zinc price of 6,250 francs.</title>
<headline>Union Miniere sets new zinc price of 6,250 francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Miniere SA subsidiary Union Miniere France said on Wednesday it had set a new indicative zinc price of 6,250 francs per tonne, effective today.</p>
<p>This is higher than the last reported posting of 6,000 francs per tonne on October 9.</p>
<p>The company said the decision was in line with market developments.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
